\subsection{A Feasible Class of Instances}

\newcommand{\specialInst}{dually connected matching\xspace}
\newcommand{\edgedeletion}{{-}}


In this section we introduce a class of instances for which a $V'$-cycle  $\acycle$ exists and can be computed in polynomial time.
%
%
These instances are those which have a \emph{\specialInst}.


