5:This problem is PSPACE-complete in general (\cite{cmapfTateo}, \cite{DBLP:journals/aamas/CharrierQSS20}). Recently, it has been proven PSPACE-complete even if the environment is included in a 3D grid and the connectivity is given with a radius $\radius$ (two agents can communicate if their distance is at most $\rho$) \cite{cmapfIsse}. 
