   105	    Figure~\ref{fig:monotone_planar_sat_example} shows a planar embedding of \inciGraph of $\phi$ and $\pi$ where all the positive clauses are inside the curve formed by the variable cycle while all the negative ones are outside.
   106	\end{example}
