    91	\emph{\PLLPTSAT} is the restriction of 3-SAT to \PLLPTformula. More precisely, the input contains a formula $\phi$, a cycle $\pi$, and a planar embedding of $\litClauGraphSign{\phi, \pi}$. W.l.o.g. the input could also be $\phi$ and a literal cycle $\pi$, as a planar embedding of $\litClauGraphSign{\phi, \pi}$ is computable from $\phi$ and $\pi$ in polynomial time in the size of $\phi$ and $\pi$ (see \cite{hopcroft1974efficient} for a poly-time algorithm to compute a planar embedding from an abstract graph).
    92	
