The result is not yet shippable: every script-owned oracle call returned OpenRouter HTTP 403, “Key limit exceeded.” These are correctly recorded as errors, not model failures, so no hardness verdict was fabricated. A refreshed `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` is required to rerun the bare and G9 arms.
