src/sections/section_pspace_completeness_reconfig.tex:2:We are now interested in the complexity of the reconfiguration version of \LPTSAT and \PLLPTSAT. They are respectively the Boolean reconfiguration problems restricted to linear planar 3-CNFs, and linear literal-planar 3-CNF.
