codex
The exact interface checks now pass: corruption cases have distinct failure classes, canonicalization survives variable renaming, clause/literal reordering, and independent polarity changes across 20 instances, and doubling the ambient graph raises variables from 234 to 450 while keeping the answer at 160 moves. The structure-aware guess test produced 0 valid paths in 200,000 samples.
